# Words sent in the made-up chat: they fly into their bubble; the fixture's agent sets to work (its activity comes in),
# and its answer comes out of the activity's avatar (emit.mbt): fold, float, spit, return.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 看一下列表的高度
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 4500
